# Exact S64 shape used by the ns-3 replay: 512 GPU endpoints, 8 leaves,
# and 2 spine switches. Hosts 0..511 remain the GPU/rank endpoints.
Nodes 512
Tiers 2
Podsize 512

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 64
Radix_Up 2
Downlink_Latency_ns 5000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Oversubscribed 32

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 8
Downlink_Latency_ns 5000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
